From 24af136848fc5ce26d5b7c260ceaacc1dc2b07b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nebur692 <nebur_692@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:07:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] tests: GHSA-fpwc-w8rq-cr92 expects upstream's 307 behaviour
 again (GH-11274)

The test was adapted for branches without GH-11274, where a 307 redirect
turns a POST into a GET and drops its body ("fix fpwc test for 7.3 (307
redirects are followed with GET)"). With the GH-11274 backport the method
and body are kept, as upstream and 7.4 do, so the expectation goes back to
upstream's (the same block as in Remi's 7.4.33-32).
---
 ext/standard/tests/http/ghsa-fpwc-w8rq-cr92.phpt | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ext/standard/tests/http/ghsa-fpwc-w8rq-cr92.phpt b/ext/standard/tests/http/ghsa-fpwc-w8rq-cr92.phpt
index a2fddb02..69b89360 100644
--- a/ext/standard/tests/http/ghsa-fpwc-w8rq-cr92.phpt
+++ b/ext/standard/tests/http/ghsa-fpwc-w8rq-cr92.phpt
@@ -144,12 +144,14 @@ string(2) "OK"
   X-Custom: 2
 string(2) "OK"
 --- credential header last in the bag (307) ---
-GET /second HTTP/1.0
+POST /second HTTP/1.0
 Host: ...
 Connection: close
+Content-Length: 11
 X-Custom: keep-me
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
 
---- malformed header bags ---
+hello=world--- malformed header bags ---
   folded value        SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
   folded value (tab)  SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
   lone CR             SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
-- 
2.55.0

